WEBVTT

00:02:29.579 --> 00:02:31.788
So, what is happening
at the level of the brain

00:02:31.829 --> 00:02:34.163
when we're updating our impressions?

00:02:34.288 --> 00:02:35.496
Using fMRI,

00:02:35.538 --> 00:02:38.413
or functional Magnetic Resonance Imaging,

00:02:38.454 --> 00:02:41.829
researchers have identified
an extended network of brain regions

00:02:41.871 --> 00:02:44.079
that respond to new information

00:02:44.121 --> 00:02:46.704
that’s inconsistent
with initial impressions.

00:02:46.746 --> 00:02:50.204
These include areas typically associated
with social cognition,

00:02:50.246 --> 00:02:52.913
attention, and cognitive control.

00:02:52.954 --> 00:02:57.454
Moreover, when updating impressions
based on people’s behaviors,

00:02:57.496 --> 00:03:00.579
activity in the ventrolateral
prefrontal cortex